      "proposed": "FRONTEND-LANGUAGE:Native JavaScript ESM+JSDoc is the sole authored WebView presentation language and owns settings+tool-panels+tables+forms+state-presentation; BUILD:standalone SWC transform>ESM>Esbuild bundle with Rust contract validation; formal evaluator verifies authored frontend language_id=native-javascript-esm fail-closed;MINIMIZATION:JavaScript-ESM usage is sparing;native GPUI/egui and Rust/Tauri views own interaction-critical and high-volume surfaces;JavaScript-ESM owns only the irreducible WebView presentation surface and no business,orchestration,runtime or data logic;TYPESCRIPT:forbidden with zero authored source or grandfathering\n\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
